msgid "Issues"
msgstr "Masalah"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam1/issues.rst:4
msgid ""
"Some CMOS camera boards seem to have a lens horizontal alignment issue. The "
"sample images below show the difference in lens alignment between CMOS "
"camera boards -- a regular CMOS camera board (left) and a problem one "
"(right):"
msgstr ""
"Beberapa papan kamera CMOS tampaknya memiliki masalah penyelarasan "
"horizontal lensa. Gambar contoh di bawah menunjukkan perbedaan penyelarasan "
"lensa antara papan kamera CMOS -- papan kamera CMOS biasa (kiri) dan yang "
"bermasalah (kanan):"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam1/issues.rst:15
msgid "|c1iss1| |c1iss2|"
msgstr "|c1iss1| |c1iss2|"

